---

## Learning Outcomes

* Learned how to clean and prepare real-world datasets.
* Handled missing values and duplicate records effectively.
* Understood the importance of balancing datasets for fair predictions.
* Applied feature scaling to improve machine learning performance.
* Split datasets into training and testing subsets for reliable model evaluation.
* Prepared high-quality data for building loan eligibility prediction models.

---

## Conclusion

Epic 3 establishes a strong foundation for machine learning by transforming raw loan application data into a clean, balanced, normalized, and well-structured dataset. These preprocessing techniques improve model accuracy, reduce bias, and ensure reliable loan eligibility predictions in the Smart Lender application.

